actor-resin-turret =
    .name = Resin Turret
    .description = Spits acid at anything that comes near. Needs an Evolution Tower. Place it near a Drone or the Queen.
actor-resin-silo =
    .name = Resin Silo
    .description = A second hive: trains xenos and brings in a little requisition. Place it near the Queen.
actor-forward-hive =
    .name = Forward Hive
    .description = Expand: a hive at the edge of your weeds that spreads its own weeds, opens the build area, trains xenos and sees far. Needs an Evolution Tower. Marines need not destroy it to win.
actor-resin-trap =
    .name = Resin Trap
    .description = Sticky resin: a marine who comes close is stuck and stung for a moment. Needs an Evolution Tower.
actor-mini-silo =
    .name = Mini Silo
    .description = Trains xenos and brings in a little requisition. Place it near the Queen.
actor-medic =
    .name = TGMC Corpsman
    .description = Patches up squadmates. Costs 120 requisition.
actor-engineer =
    .name = TGMC Engineer
    .description = Builds marine structures within a few cells of itself, and repairs them. Costs 130 requisition.
actor-sentry-turret =
    .name = Sentry Turret
    .description = Automatic gun emplacement. Needs an Armory. Place it near an Engineer.
actor-mortar-emplacement =
    .name = Mortar Emplacement
    .description = Fixed mortar that out-ranges the mortarman. Needs an Armory. Fires at what your units can see.
actor-artillery-emplacement =
    .name = Artillery Emplacement
    .description = Howitzer with the longest reach and a heavy shell, slow to reload. Needs an Ordnance Depot.
actor-cryo-pod =
    .name = Cryo Pod
    .description = Trains marines. Place it near an Engineer.
actor-vendor =
    .name = Marine Vendor
    .description = Trains marines and brings in a little requisition. Place it near an Engineer.
actor-rifleman =
    .name = TGMC Rifleman
    .description = Standard squad rifleman. Costs 100 requisition.
actor-upgrade-rifle-t12 =
    .name = T-12 Rifles
    .description = Issues every rifleman the T-12 assault rifle in place of the T-18 carbine: more damage, a little more range. Needs an Armory. Costs 300 requisition.
actor-upgrade-rifle-m412 =
    .name = M412 Rifles
    .description = Issues every rifleman the M412: the longest reach of the rifles, at a slower rate of fire. Needs the T-12 Rifles. Costs 500 requisition.
actor-upgrade-smg-m25 =
    .name = M25 SMGs
    .description = Medics and field commanders trade the T-19 for the M25: a faster stream of rounds and a longer reach. Needs an Armory. Costs 300 requisition.
actor-upgrade-shotgun-sh410 =
    .name = SH-410 Shotguns
    .description = Engineers and skirmishers trade the pump shotgun for the SH-410: eight pellets of heavier buckshot and more reach. Needs an Armory and an Ordnance Depot. Costs 450 requisition.
actor-upgrade-mg-minigun =
    .name = Miniguns
    .description = Machine gunners trade the SG-60 for the minigun: bursts of eight rounds at the cost of some range. Needs a Workshop and an Ordnance Depot. Costs 800 requisition.
actor-upgrade-rocket-heavy =
    .name = Heavy RPGs
    .description = Rocketeers trade the SADAR for the heavy RPG: a bigger blast that knocks walls down, with a slower reload and more range. Needs an Ordnance Depot and a Workshop. Costs 800 requisition.
actor-upgrade-smg-t90 =
    .name = T-90 SMGs
    .description = Medics and field commanders move on to the T-90: a little more punch and reach than the M25. Needs the M25 SMGs and an Armory. Costs 400 requisition.
actor-upgrade-sniper-svd =
    .name = SVD Rifles
    .description = Snipers trade the Mosin for the SVD: a quicker cycle, a little less punch per shot. Needs an Armory. Costs 450 requisition.
actor-upgrade-sniper-tx8 =
    .name = TX-8 Rifles
    .description = Snipers move on to the TX-8: more punch and a longer reach than the SVD. Needs the SVD Rifles and an Ordnance Depot. Costs 700 requisition.
actor-upgrade-sniper-m42c =
    .name = M42C Rifles
    .description = Snipers move on to the M42C: the heaviest single shot, with a slow cycle. Needs the TX-8 Rifles and a Workshop. Costs 1000 requisition.
actor-upgrade-carapace-1 =
    .name = Carapace I
    .description = Every xeno grows a thicker shell and takes 13 percent less damage. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 300 requisition.
actor-upgrade-carapace-2 =
    .name = Carapace II
    .description = A second layer of plates: another 13 percent less damage taken, and xenos move a little slower. Needs a Maturity Tower and Carapace I. Costs 600 requisition.
actor-upgrade-claws =
    .name = Sharper Claws
    .description = Every xeno hits 15 percent harder. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 300 requisition.
actor-upgrade-hive-speed =
    .name = Hive Speed
    .description = The hive drives its xenos on: they move 12 percent faster. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 400 requisition.
actor-warrior =
    .name = Xeno Warrior
    .description = Heavy melee slam that hits everything around it. Needs a Maturity Tower. Costs 200 requisition.
actor-smartgunner =
    .name = TGMC Smartgunner
    .description = Rapid, spread fire at short range. Needs an Armory. Costs 200 requisition.
actor-sniper =
    .name = TGMC Sniper
    .description = One long-range shot every few seconds. Needs an Armory. Costs 260 requisition.
actor-rocketeer =
    .name = TGMC SADAR Rocketeer
    .description = Fires RL-152 rockets that hit hard in a small area. Needs an Armory. Costs 280 requisition.
actor-blademan =
    .name = TGMC Vali Blademan
    .description = Melee fighter with a Vali blade. Needs an Armory. Costs 160 requisition.
actor-mortarman =
    .name = TGMC Mortarman
    .description = Long-range indirect shells, cannot hit close targets. Needs an Ordnance Depot. Costs 300 requisition.
actor-flamer =
    .name = TGMC Flamer
    .description = Burns everything in a short cone. Needs an Armory. Costs 220 requisition.
actor-machinegunner =
    .name = TGMC Machine Gunner
    .description = Sustained full-auto fire with the MG-60. Needs an Armory. Costs 230 requisition.
actor-grenadier =
    .name = TGMC Grenadier
    .description = Lobs grenades that splash over a wide area. Needs an Ordnance Depot. Costs 180 requisition.
actor-queen =
    .name = Xeno Queen
    .description = Builds every hive structure, including the towers and silos, within a few cells of herself. Only one. Needs a Resin Silo. Costs 400 requisition.
actor-miner =
    .name = Miner
    .description = Mines supplies: steady requisition income. Place it near an Engineer. Costs 150 requisition.
actor-miner-field =
    .name = Ore field
    .description = An ore field. Broken at the start: repair it with an Engineer's torch and it becomes your Miner.
actor-cade =
    .name = Cade
    .description = Cheap barricade. Place one end, then the other, to build a line. Place it near an Engineer.
actor-armory =
    .name = Armory
    .description = Unlocks the Smartgunner and the Sentry Turret. Place it near an Engineer. Costs 300 requisition.
actor-ordnance-depot =
    .name = Ordnance Depot
    .description = Unlocks the Grenadier. Needs an Armory. Place it near an Engineer. Costs 400 requisition.
actor-weeds =
    .name = Weeds
    .description = Cheap resin growth with no income. Spread weeds to extend where minor structures can be placed. Costs 15 requisition.
actor-weed-node =
    .name = Weed Node
    .description = Spreads weeds that feed the hive: steady requisition income. Place it near a Drone or the Queen. Costs 120 requisition.
actor-resin-wall =
    .name = Resin Wall
    .description = Cheap resin barrier. Place one end, then the other, to build a line. Place it near a Drone or the Queen.
actor-evolution-tower =
    .name = Evolution Tower
    .description = Unlocks the Hunter, the Sentinel and the Resin Turret. Place it near the Queen. Costs 300 requisition.
actor-maturity-tower =
    .name = Maturity Tower
    .description = Unlocks the Warrior. Needs an Evolution Tower. Place it near the Queen. Costs 450 requisition.
actor-spitter =
    .name = Xeno Spitter
    .description = Ranged acid spitter. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 100 requisition.
actor-praetorian =
    .name = Xeno Praetorian
    .description = Tough melee striker. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 150 requisition.
actor-crusher =
    .name = Xeno Crusher
    .description = Heavy brawler with a wide slam. Needs a Maturity Tower. Costs 250 requisition.
actor-ravager =
    .name = Xeno Ravager
    .description = Fast melee attacker. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 140 requisition.
actor-defiler =
    .name = Xeno Defiler
    .description = Lobs canisters that burst into clouds of neurotoxin: enemies inside are slowed and choked. Needs a Maturity Tower. Costs 220 requisition.
actor-boiler =
    .name = Xeno Boiler
    .description = Xeno artillery: lobs globs of acid from far away that splash wide and leave a pool. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 160 requisition.
actor-carrier =
    .name = Xeno Carrier
    .description = Melee clinger. Needs a Maturity Tower. Costs 180 requisition.
actor-warlock =
    .name = Xeno Warlock
    .description = Ranged psionic spitter. Needs a Maturity Tower. Costs 170 requisition.
actor-shrike =
    .name = Xeno Shrike
    .description = Fast screeching melee attacker. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 130 requisition.
actor-widow =
    .name = Xeno Widow
    .description = Acid-spitting ambusher. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 150 requisition.
actor-wraith =
    .name = Xeno Wraith
    .description = Fast melee stalker. Needs a Maturity Tower. Costs 160 requisition.
actor-bull =
    .name = Xeno Bull
    .description = Charging melee heavy. Needs a Maturity Tower. Costs 200 requisition.
actor-behemoth =
    .name = Xeno Behemoth
    .description = Huge slow heavy slam. Needs a Maturity Tower. Costs 350 requisition.
actor-facehugger =
    .name = Facehugger
    .description = Hunts marines. Latches on and plants an embryo; the marine bursts into a larva after about 30 seconds unless a medic heals them first. Costs 40 requisition.
actor-larva =
    .name = Xeno Larva
notification-evolve-cash = Not enough requisition to evolve.
notification-evolve-tech = The hive lacks the structure that caste needs.
actor-heavygunner =
    .name = Gungnir Heavy Gunner
    .description = Heavy Jaeger Gungnir exoskeleton and a minigun: slow, but fires fast and shrugs off claws and acid. Needs an Ordnance Depot. Costs 450 requisition.
actor-demolitionist =
    .name = EOD Demolitionist
    .description = High-explosive launcher and heavy Jaeger EOD anti-blast armour. Blasts hurt friendly units too, but not him. Needs an Ordnance Depot. Costs 420 requisition.

actor-egg =
    .name = Hugger Egg
    .description = Opens when a marine comes near and releases a facehugger, then grows another. Fragile. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 40 requisition.
checkbox-tgmc-friendlyfire =
    .label = Explosive Friendly Fire
    .description = Grenades, mortars and rockets hurt your own units too.
checkbox-tgmc-infestation =
    .label = Facehugger Infestation
    .description = Facehuggers can implant marines, who burst into larvae unless healed.
checkbox-tgmc-maturity =
    .label = Xeno Maturity
    .description = Xenos grow stronger with age while the hive has a Maturity Tower.
checkbox-tgmc-floatingtext =
    .label = Floating Damage Numbers
    .description = Show damage and healing as numbers that float up from units.
checkbox-tgmc-tilestep =
    .label = Tile-by-Tile Movement
    .description = A move order walks one cell toward where you click, like stepping in SS13.
actor-medbay =
    .name = Medbay
    .description = Heals marines within four cells on its own, and a heal clears a facehugger's embryo. Needs an Armory. Costs 250 requisition.
actor-ammo-station =
    .name = Ammo Station
    .description = Marines within four cells reload their magazines much faster. Needs an Armory. Costs 200 requisition.
actor-workshop =
    .name = Workshop
    .description = Builds the mech. Needs an Ordnance Depot. Costs 400 requisition.
actor-mech =
    .name = Marine Mech
    .description = TGMC's medium mech: slow and very tough. Each one comes out in a random fit: assault (autocannon and rocket pod), flame (shotgun and flamer), support (SMG and RPG) or tow (autocannon and anti-armour missile). Built at a Workshop. Costs 800 requisition.
actor-recovery-pylon =
    .name = Recovery Pylon
    .description = Mends xenos within four cells. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 220 requisition.
actor-gargoyle =
    .name = Gargoyle
    .description = A lookout that sees far. Needs an Evolution Tower. Costs 150 requisition.
support-cas =
    .name = Bomb Run
    .description = The Condor drops five bombs along a line through the spot you pick. The blast hurts your own units too. Recharges in two minutes.
support-gun =
    .name = 30mm Gun Run
    .description = The Condor strafes a strip with its cannon: many light hits that shred infantry. Recharges in one minute.
support-minirocket =
    .name = Mini-Rockets
    .description = A salvo of six guided rockets along a line. Lands after a short flight. Recharges in 90 seconds.
support-flare =
    .name = Illumination Flare
    .description = A parachute flare that reveals the spot for 40 seconds. Harmless. Recharges in 40 seconds.
support-widowmaker =
    .name = Widowmaker Missile
    .description = One very fast anti-armour missile with a tight, heavy blast. Needs a Workshop. Recharges in two minutes.
support-laser =
    .name = Laser Battery
    .description = A beam burns a line across the spot and sets the ground alight for a moment. Needs a Workshop. Recharges in 90 seconds.
support-napalm =
    .name = Napalm
    .description = Six napalm canisters along a line through the spot you pick, a swath about 16 cells long. The ground burns for 36 seconds and hurts everything in it, yours too. Needs a Workshop. Recharges in 2.5 minutes.
support-fatty =
    .name = Fatty Cluster Missile
    .description = One blast, then three seconds later a ring of eight more around it. Needs a Workshop. Recharges in three minutes.
support-moab =
    .name = MOAB
    .description = A 1000lb bomb that wipes out everything in a huge circle. It takes six seconds to land. Needs a Workshop. Recharges in four minutes.
support-power-timer = { $player }'s { $support-power }: { $time }
