help-title = TGMC CONTROLS (/ to close)
help-button = ?
help-1 = Left-click or drag: select. Right-click: move or attack.
help-2 = A then click: attack-move. S: stop. Ctrl+number: make a group.
help-3 = F (Deploy): evolve the selected xeno. Shift+F: devolve it.
help-4 = Runners, Hunters, Warriors and Crushers leap at enemies they chase.
help-5 = A facehugged marine bursts after a minute. A corpsman or Medbay heal cures him.
help-6 = Marines reload when their magazine runs dry. Ammo Stations speed it up.
help-7 = Explosives hurt your own units too. EOD armour shrugs off blasts.
help-8 = CAS (top left): pick a munition (bombs, 30mm, rockets, flare, missiles) and a spot. Heavy ones need a Workshop.
help-9 = Weeds spread from Weed Nodes. Xenos build near weeds; marines near their base.
help-10 = Lobby options switch friendly fire, facehuggers, maturity and tile movement.
